note fsum: d[i] = a[i] + f16 h[i] in f32 for 4 lanes (h binary16 bits, converted here; zero and normal
note inputs), and returns the f32 bit pattern of d[0] + d[3]: an f32 view, a ushort view and an f32 edit array.
fn h2b h ushort to uint
v = uint h
s = shl and shr v 15 1 31
e = and shr v 10 31
m = and v 1023
if eq e 0
ret s
end
ret or or s shl add e 112 23 shl m 13
end
fn fsum a view f32 4 h view ushort 4 d edit f32 4 to ulong
for i ulong 4
put d i add get a i bitcast f32 h2b get h i
end
ret ulong bitcast uint add get d 0 get d 3
end
